      "created_at": "2015-04-15T15:55:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Something that will either make their game harder or your game easier. Some I had in mind were:</p><p>(As I mentioned before) Your oppenent must face the villian in advanced rules</p><p>Your opponet mus start the battle with each Hero taken 5 damage already</p><p>Your villian starts with a certain amount of health gone already (I was thinking 10%, rounded down. So deadline would start with 8 damage taken, Omnitron would start with 10 damage taken, etc, etc)</p><p>Stuff like that that you can use before the fight to make it more interesting, and to help you</p>",
